E205                             ; =============================================================================
E205                             ;  Reading the program
E205                             ;    peek: A = the character at IP, IP unchanged, Y = 0
E205                             ;    getc: the same, then IP moves on; flags follow A
E205                             ;    incip: IP moves on; keeps A, the carry and Y
E205                             ; =============================================================================
E205                             ; rdhex: if IP is at a hex digit (0-9, A-F, a-f), return its value in A with
E205                             ; the carry clear and IP moved on; otherwise the carry is set and IP stays.
E205                             ; Y = 0.
